# Vertex Global — environment variables
#
# API key audit (2026-09-21): no hardcoded API keys, tokens, or secrets were
# found anywhere in the codebase. This file is a placeholder scaffold for any
# future client-side configuration.
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle —
# never put a real secret behind that prefix, since it ships in the built JS.
# Copy this file to .env (already gitignored) and fill in real values there.

# Example — uncomment and set if/when needed:
# VITE_ANALYTICS_ID=
